  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "Scratch Bot会自动刮开彩票并揭示奖励，把手动刮奖逐步转化为可挂机运转的彩金引擎。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Unlock Scratch Bot, your tireless mechanical friend who scratches and reveals the rewards for you. Turn your run into a full-blown jackpot engine as your balance shoots through the roof while you sit back and relax.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3948120/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "高额彩金卡往往附带严厉惩罚，有的提供稳定收入，有的则可能直接威胁整次跑局。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "But power always comes with risk. Some cards tempt you with monstrous payouts at the cost of nasty penalties. Some offer steady income… others threaten your entire run.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3948120/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "转生会重置当前跑局并获得Jack Points，用于购买永久升级，进一步塑造稳健、爆发或混沌的幸运引擎。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Prestige to reset your run, gather Jack Points, and spend them on permanent upgrades that reshape your strategy. Build your own luck engine: Slow and steady, wildly explosive, or pure chaos.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3948120/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
